spoiler, major bug ahead...























Try picking up the most expensive item in the shop and throw it down.
You get paid for it.  Keep on doing it until the shopkeeper runs
out of money, you get credit!   Can't find something expensive,
use something of your own.

Or pick up many of the same item, throw them down one at at time,
get paid for the pile on the floor each time (useful at delis where
not many high priced items).

Don't try this in liquor stores though :-!

I don't know if they fixed this in 3.1.1, I play 3.1.0.  

Make sure you are playing a version of Nethack which has checkpointing
turned on though, as you tend to get 'error in shopkeeper administration'
type of errors and the game frequently crashes.  Make sure the recover
command is compiled and ready.

